# Palani's Hatcher ("Other Dinosaurs you control have haste"; enters: two 0/1 green Dinosaur Egg tokens; at the beginning of combat
# on your turn, if you control one or more Eggs, sacrifice an Egg, then create a 3/3 green Dinosaur token). Turn 1: five Moxen pay for the
# Hatcher, whose enters trigger makes two Eggs; at the beginning of combat one Egg is sacrificed and the 3/3 Dinosaur token made
# in its place has haste from the Hatcher (it attacks the turn it is made), while the Hatcher, which is no "other" Dinosaur, is
# summoning sick and refused. Turn 2: Bot2's own Pygmy Allosaurus (a Dinosaur Bot1's Hatcher does not reach) has no haste. Turn 3:
# Bot1's Pygmy Allosaurus, cast this turn, has haste and attacks; the second Egg is sacrificed for a second Dinosaur token.
# CR 111.1, 603.4, 701.21a, 702.10a, 613.1f.

